  This document describes for all organizations, the steps for:  

  establishing organizational boundaries, in accordance with either a control approach (financial or operational) or an equity share approach;  
  establishing reporting boundaries, by identifying direct and indirect emissions to be quantified and reported; for each category of emission, guidance is provided on specific boundaries and methodologies for the quantification of GHG emissions and removals;  
